616	            <div style={{ fontSize: 12, color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.55)', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
617	              {selectedFight.segmentation_review_reason
618	                ?? 'Segmentation could not confirm these rounds against the scoreboard.'}
619	              {' '}Check the ROUNDS lane below and drag the edges before labelling.
