5	   via the palette or a keyboard shortcut. Hand strikes follow the
6	   numeric boxing convention (1 jab · 2 straight · 3-4 hooks · 5-6
7	   uppercuts). Annotations auto-save and show in a feed that behaves
8	   like the live player feed (click to seek). */
